    "Native worker errors use explicit bounded strict/generation/history code sets. Supervisor accepts bounded known persistence codes, falls back safely for oversized/unknown errors and honors cleanup versus manual retention even if the failure write fails. Shutdown diagnostics separately retain attempt-storage failure."
